  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Treatment of Children with Leukemia &amp; Cancer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Each year 200.000 people receive cancer diagnosis. Unfortunately, treatment is expensive, centers are inadequate &amp; quality of care is low. Due to this reason, LOSEV-Foundation for Children with Leukemia has been providing complimentary treatment at its LOSANTE Hospital for more than 65.000 registered patients since 1998.Treatment &amp; accommodation are completely free of charge for our patients &amp; all donations are used for this purpose. Thank you for supporting our fight against cancer!</narrative>
  </description>
